    "# Tutorial\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook is **executed when the docs build** (mkdocs-jupyter), so it can't\n",
    "drift from the code. Throwaway scratch lives in `exploratory/`; this is curated,\n",
    "kept-true narrative."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "1",
   "metadata": {},
